Sun Oct 25 20:37:16 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to version 0.9.0:
  * Correctness and speed release: fp16/bf16 warps and geometry,
    faster blur/unsharp/CLAHE/morphology, RANSAC and SIFT close
    to OpenCV, ONNX-exportable augmentations
  * RandomMosaic, XFeat and batch-consistency fixes; migration
    notes on numerical baselines
- Require python-numpy >= 1.21 (new upstream dependency), raise
  python-kornia-rs to >= 0.2.0 and python-torch to >= 2.5.1,
  drop the unused python-packaging dependency

