- Initial package of python-kornia 0.8.3:
  * Differentiable computer vision library for PyTorch
  * New in 0.8.3: XFeat and ALIKED feature detectors,
    VisualPrompter batched inference, float16/bfloat16 support,
    faster depth_to_normals and point transforms, MPS and ONNX
    export fixes
  * Requires python-kornia-rs >= 0.1.9, python-packaging and
    python-torch >= 2.0

